{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A fallen guardian returns to a shattered world, where souls cry out and fragments decide fate.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soul Gatherer</strong> is a dark 3D action roguelite that challenges you to reclaim a ruined world, one soul fragment at a time.<br><br>Engage in fast-paced real-time combat as you choose your weapon before each run \u2014 whether it's a swift blade or a heavy-hitting greatsword. Every weapon offers a distinct approach to combat, letting you shape your playstyle through timing, movement, and skill execution.<br><br>Defeat elite enemies and bosses to obtain fragments \u2014 remnants of powerful beings lost to chaos. Some fragments enhance your strength, while others hold memories that slowly unveil the story of a world broken by ambition and betrayal.<br><br>You are the spirit of a once-great protector, guided by a mysterious entity known as the Timekeeper. Travel through four cursed domains \u2014 each ruled by a tormented being consumed by their past. Learn the truth behind the world's collapse and face the soul that shares your blood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather what remains. Defy what\u2019s broken. And decide what comes next.</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\uccab \uc0ac\ub0e5","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3698200/c7b1ae7d3cc6368538c158636500adeca2ab34da.jpg"},{"name":"\uc0ac\ub0e5\uafbc","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3698200/c7b1ae7d3cc6368538c158636500adeca2ab34da.jpg"},{"name":"\uc5d8\ub9ac\ud2b8 \uc0ac\ub0e5\uafbc","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3698200/c7b1ae7d3cc6368538c158636500adeca2ab34da.jpg"},{"name":"\uc815\ud654\uc790","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3698200/c7b1ae7d3cc6368538c158636500adeca2ab34da.jpg"},{"name":"\uc8fd\uc74c\uc758 \uac